.TH start-cli-backup-job-set-enabled 1  "set-enabled "
.SH NAME
start\-cli\-backup\-job\-set\-enabled \- Enable or disable an automatic backup job
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBstart\-cli backup job set\-enabled\fR <\fB\-\-enabled\fR> [\fB\-\-format\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIID\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Enable or disable an automatic backup job
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-enabled\fR \fI<ENABLED>\fR
Whether to enable the selected jobs
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
true
.IP \(bu 2
false
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-format\fR

.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIID\fR>
Automatic backup job identifier
